│       └── Shared UI components
│
├── infrastructure/
│   ├── docker/
│   └── deployment configuration
│
├── docs/
│   ├── architecture/
│   ├── api/
│   ├── database/
│   └── decisions/
│
├── tests/
│   ├── integration/
│   └── e2e/
│
├── docker-compose.yml
├── package.json
└── pnpm-workspace.yaml
```

The monorepo allows the frontend, backend, worker and shared packages to evolve together while keeping clear boundaries.

