# 6. Core Investigation Workflow

The central FaultLens workflow is:

```text
DETECT
   ↓
EXPLAIN
   ↓
REPRODUCE
   ↓
VALIDATE
   ↓
REMEMBER
```

---

## 6.1 Detect

FaultLens receives or generates signals indicating that something is wrong.

Examples:

```text
HTTP 500 rate increased
Latency increased
Database errors increased
Service unavailable
Memory usage exceeded threshold
Deployment occurred
Container restarted
```

An incident is created.

---

# 7. Incident Management

Users can:

* Create incidents
* Assign severity
* Assign owners
* Track status
* Add notes
* Add evidence
* Track investigation progress
* Add hypotheses
* Record resolution
* Generate postmortems

Example lifecycle:

```text
DETECTED
   ↓
INVESTIGATING
   ↓
MITIGATING
   ↓
RESOLVED
   ↓
POSTMORTEM
```

---

