# 30. What Makes FaultLens Different?

FaultLens is not intended to be another:

* CRUD dashboard
* Jira clone
* Basic monitoring dashboard
* ChatGPT wrapper
* Log viewer
* Generic AI SaaS

Its central engineering challenge is:

> **How can a software system connect distributed production evidence into a structured failure investigation?**

The project therefore demonstrates concepts across multiple areas:

```text
Frontend Engineering
        +
Backend Engineering
        +
Database Design
        +
Distributed Systems
        +
Asynchronous Processing
        +
Real-Time Systems
        +
Observability
        +
Incident Management
        +
Fault Injection
        +
Testing
        +
Security
        +
DevOps
        +
AI Engineering
```

---

